Edge-to-edge UI, AMOLED reel theme & compatibility fixes

• Added enableEdgeToEdge() to BaseActivity so all screens draw
  behind system bars properly — no more cutoffs or overlaps.
• Removed hardcoded statusBarColor from themes. Added
  fitsSystemWindows=true on all activity layouts to keep
  content safe from system bars.
• New SystemBarUtils helper for API 24+ that lets us switch
  between transparent bars (normal screens) and true-black
  AMOLED bars (reel screen) with white icons.
• Reel screen now has Instagram-style black status + nav bar,
  immersive full-screen mode (swipe to reveal), and bottom
  nav hidden during viewing.
• Force dark color scheme on reel screen only — rest of app
  stays unaffected.
• SplashActivity: removed duplicate finish() call (was
  triggering "Duplicate finish request" in logcat).
• ShortsFragment: added error handling around camera
  bindToLifecycle() so CameraX doesn't crash on devices
  with service binding issues.
• PlayerManager: wrapped all ExoPlayer operations in try-catch
  with automatic error recovery.
• VideoViewHolder: added 3-second safety timeout on thumbnail
  ExoPlayer to prevent lingering codec resources.
• HomeAdapter: replaced deprecated DefaultDataSourceFactory
  with DefaultDataSource.Factory.
• DataPrefetchService: added error listeners on pre-built
  players, graceful failure handling.
• LoginScreen: added systemBarsPadding() for proper edge-to-edge.
• Removed unused dependencies (accompanist-pager).
